## docs/
### design.md
 10|
*11|Agent responsibilities are independent of model vendors. The current lead and reviewer inherit Pi's selected provider/model through its public model registry, including custom providers and current authentication. A separate evidence assistant remains planned. If role-specific model choices are added, each must resolve a provider/model pair from Pi's registry and check capabilities; the default remains the user's selected model. No role is tied to a vendor, named model family or silent vendor fallback.
